<Placemark><name>Younger's Cave, Monegaw Springs</name><description>Approximate area, 0.6 mi radius

Bluff above the Osage River near Monegaw Springs, St. Clair County. Pinned on USGS 'Youngers Lookout'; the cave isn't separately mapped.

Cole Younger is said to have hidden out in a bluff cave here while family and friends lived nearby. Farther from you than the rest, but still in the Ozarks.

Access: Ownership not checked.

Sources:
Missouri State Archives: Caves in History and Legend: https://www.sos.mo.gov/archives/presentations/ap_transcripts/caves</description><styleUrl>#area</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-93.843820,38.025590</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
